  "reasoning": "The claim that mRNA COVID-19 vaccines alter human DNA is biologically impossible and demonstrably false. Vaccine mRNA delivers instructions to cellular ribosomes located in the cytoplasm to produce the spike protein; it never enters the cell nucleus where genomic DNA is stored. Furthermore, human cells lack the reverse transcriptase enzymes necessary to convert RNA back into DNA, and mRNA degrades rapidly after translation. Major public health organizations and scientific consensus worldwide confirm that mRNA vaccines do not interact with or integrate into the human genome.",
